{
  "name": "MRO at Mars (PlanDev 05-orbiter)",
  "description": "MRO trajectory from mro_psp.bsp, the same kernel set examples/05-orbiter loads (spice-kernels/latest_meta_kernel.tm). No attitude (CK) or instrument kernels are loaded, so MRO has no orientation and no instrument geometry here. Mars orientation comes from pck00011_n0066.tpc, NAIF's form of pck00011 for N0066 toolkits (Cosmolabe's cspice-wasm): its Mars data equal pck00011.tpc, which N0066 misreads (Mars pole off by ~2.2°).",
